析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"9cf37f0df8f4d6bd00beb8c92cebe88f07431911c16227896760d446ca13e075","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"剂量与给药方案：SMOKE-r2-1Q口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC201）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"e34c40359a34a102d2dfa1f75a981d2e54d1ce48cf6633d67a2a2d06f8c034d8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_005"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_002","es_004","es_005"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为一项随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期临床研究，旨在对SMOKE-r2-1Q口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC201）治疗射血分数降低的心力衰竭（HFrEF）进行概念验证与剂量探索。研究设置KZ-sGC201低剂量（2.5 mg qd）、中剂量（5 mg qd）、高剂量（10 mg qd）三个活性治疗组及安慰剂对照组，各组受试者每日晨起随餐口服给药，总治疗周期为12周。研究采用平行组分配模型，在多个研究中心同步开展。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用协方差分析（ANCOVA，基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势，安全性数据以描述统计呈现，次要终点按预先设定的层级顺序进行分析。","rationale":"总体设计要素（随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心）、三剂量组设置、12周治疗周期、FAS分析集、ANCOVA方法及剂量-反应趋势检验均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。医学经理需确认：（1）'每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整'中具体调整规则是否在本章或后续章节展开；（2）安慰剂匹配方式（外观、给药时间）是否需在本章提及。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_931cc5c59150d786","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:bab8adf4959238e79c7db6fc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004153402_3ea05514","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"估计目标策略：治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。","quote_sha256":"eb44177581223de72875983b0f1d70b25c2bbcf98304d5b17e2c2764beca8e56","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"统计分析策略：FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"9cf37f0df8f4d6bd00beb8c92cebe88f07431911c16227896760d446ca13e075","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"样本量策略：II期探索性设计：每组约60例（共约240例），基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算，用于概念验证与剂量选择。","quote_sha256":"5f598e1d608dd27ea2bd6080417002fe0f5e763c866e33ca8a5c13c697490e10","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"内在研究目的：概念验证（PoC）；剂量探索","quote_sha256":"2d096e242bbd65d0c9236718d79e77a388e84cb9640b99bd47662a6ce8faab31","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_008"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_003","es_004","es_007","es_008"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索并确认NT-proBNP组间差值效应量的文献出处，在正文或参考文献中注明","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_42_01","missing_source_classes":["NT-proBNP效应量文献来源"],"target":"设计依据中'文献效应量'的具体来源"},{"action":"确认是否需在本章补充说明不设置期中分析与样本量再估计的理由","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_42_02","missing_source_classes":["项目统计设计决策记录"],"target":"设计依据中为何不设置期中分析/样本量再估计的论证"}],"heading":"设计依据","missing_source_classes":["既往sGC刺激剂II/III期研究设计参照","NT-proBNP效应量文献来源"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用治疗策略（treatment policy）作为估计目标策略：无论受试者在治疗期间是否发生剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按其随机分组的组别进行分析；治疗期间发生的终点前事件按复合策略处理。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势，安全性采用描述统计，次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。样本量方面，每组约60例、共约240例，基于NT-proBNP组间差值的文献效应量与80%把握度估算，服务于概念验证与剂量选择目的。上述设计选择与II期概念验证及剂量探索的研究定位一致，旨在通过多剂量水平比较获取初步疗效信号并识别后续确证性研究的推荐剂量。","rationale":"治疗策略估计目标、FAS/ANCOVA/层级分析、样本量估算依据及研究目的（概念验证+剂量探索）均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。医学经理需确认：（1）治疗策略选择是否需补充与假设策略的对比论证；（2）'文献效应量'的具体来源文献是否需在正文或参考文献中列明；（3）是否需在本章说明为何不设置期中分析或样本量再估计。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标、剂量选择、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_9830625d3bb46bbe","section_number":"4.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:bab8adf4959238e79c7db6fc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004153402_3ea05514","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取KZ-sGC201 IB或等效非临床/临床摘要，提取受体亲和力、cGMP激活EC50、NOAEL、安全窗、I期PK/PD及既往sGC刺激剂剂量-效应数据后撰写","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_421_01","missing_source_classes":["KZ-sGC201研究者手册（IB）或等效非临床/临床摘要","sGC刺激剂类药物既往临床剂量-效应文献","KZ-sGC201 I期PK/PD数据"],"target":"4.2.1剂量选择依据全文"},{"action":"确认'按方案规定剂量调整'的具体规则来源（IB、前期研究或医学决策记录）","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_421_02","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整规则来源文件"],"target":"剂量调整规则（减量/暂停/永久停药触发条件）"}],"heading":"剂量选择依据","missing_source_classes":["KZ-sGC201研究者手册（IB）或等效非临床/临床摘要","sGC刺激剂类药物既往临床剂量-效应文献","KZ-sGC201 I期PK/PD数据","剂量选择会议纪要或医学决策记录"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前允许来源仅给出KZ-sGC201三个剂量水平（2.5/5/10 mg qd）及'每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整'的操作描述，但未提供该药物的非临床药理学（受体亲和力、cGMP激活EC50）、毒理学（NOAEL、安全窗）、I期人体药代动力学/药效学数据、既往sGC刺激剂类药物的剂量-暴露-效应关系或II期剂量探索文献。缺少上述核心来源，无法形成有实质信息的剂量选择论证正文。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（剂量选择依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_2fe9e17d09eaafbd","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:bab8adf4959238e79c7db6fc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004153402_3ea05514","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心；II期概念验证+剂量探索，KZ-sGC201低/中/高三个剂量组与安慰剂对照，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"1c4bb296f1970929df968d37199de261be9da16fdcb1e1e16471099a327693d0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","span_id":"es_001"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_7a1441bac4c8d3e2:full-draft:bab8adf4959238e79c7db6fc","quote":"随机化；双盲；安慰剂对照；平行组；多中心","quote_sha256":"2390eec78cb63fbb744f4d0cd34ca9e3a52cae7420fe7f7e88f4c2d12a283514","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:bab8adf4959238e79c7db6fc","span_id":"es_002"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_7a1441bac4c8d3e2:full-draft:bab8adf4959238e79c7db6fc","quote":"采用随机化分配。","quote_sha256":"abb7a27e76e1676c12ab199e8d9abdac80371053749a69fb6f2ee1faa8f01db8","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:bab8adf4959238e79c7db6fc","span_id":"es_006"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_002","es_006"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认本项目随机化方案的具体参数与工具","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_43_01","missing_source_classes":["随机化方法实施细节"],"target":"随机化具体方法（区组大小、分层因素、随机表生成工具）"},{"action":"确认紧急揭盲触发条件、操作流程及揭盲后处理","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_43_02","missing_source_classes":["盲态维持与紧急揭盲流程"],"target":"盲态维持措施与紧急揭盲流程"},{"action":"确认随机化与药物分配所用系统","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_43_03","missing_source_classes":["IWRS/IRT系统选择依据"],"target":"随机化分配系统（IWRS/IRT或其他）"}],"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":["随机化方法实施细节（区组大小、分层因素、随机表生成工具）","盲态维持与紧急揭盲流程","IWRS/IRT系统选择依据"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配，受试者被随机分入KZ-sGC201低剂量（2.5 mg qd）、中剂量（5 mg qd）、高剂量（10 mg qd）或安慰剂四个组别之一。研究为双盲设计，试验参与者、研究者、监查员以及数据分析人员等对试验参与者接受某剂量试验用药品类别属于试验药物/安慰剂均不知情。","rationale":"随机化分配、双盲、四组设置（三剂量+安慰剂）来源于当前项目已确认研究事实；双盲盲态范围描述参照公司语料中双盲随机设计的通用表述。医学经理需确认：（1）随机化具体方法（区组随机、分层因素如NYHA分级或基线NT-proBNP水平）；（2）随机化生成工具与系统（IWRS/IRT或其他）；（3）盲态维持的具体措施（安慰剂匹配细节、紧急揭盲流程）；（4）盲态范围是否涵盖监查员、CRO人员等。上述实施细节在已确认事实中未给出，不得自行指定。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（随机化）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ed22b8071d6b_4221d17a1e7c1d41","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:bab8adf4959238e79c7db6fc","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7e58b72c4deda30d8a67:r4:628d02c25cbe7360","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"f4990fe8a1a5c74e441c5e1825f6c756455d2bc2